==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|monétaire}}, from {{etyl|LL.|en}} {{m|la|monetarius||pertaining to money}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|monetarius||of a mint}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|moneta||mint, coinage}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈmʌnɪtɹi/|/ˈmʌnɪtəɹi/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ˈmɑnɪteɹi/|/ˈmʌnəteɹi/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|Monetary US.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Of, pertaining to, or consisting of [[money]].

